              "value": "The bronze dragon breathes in one of two ways. The dragon can't use Breath Weapon again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Lightning** (arcane, electricity, evocation); The dragon breathes lightning in a 80-foot line that deals 8d12 electricity damage (33 basic Reflex save).\n- **Repulsion Gas** (abjuration, arcane, incapacitation, mental); The dragon breathes a 80-foot line of repulsive gas. Each creature in the area must succeed at a 33 Will save or become fleeing from the dragon for 1 round (or 2 rounds on a critical failure)."
